{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39305","headline":"东林寺再遇僧益大德 · 韦庄","name":"东林寺再遇僧益大德","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见师初事懿皇朝，三殿归来白马骄。\n上讲每教倾国听，承恩偏得内官饶。\n当时可爱人如画，今日相逢鬓已凋。\n若向君门逢旧友，爲传音信到云霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}